/E (As of July 16, 2026, the market is experiencing a slight pullback from the highs we saw earlier this year. Because of that, I am personally building a larger cash position and waiting for better opportunities. That said, I am writing this report to express my views on an industry that I will be closely watching once the market begins trending upward again.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [5]
>>
