208 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 170 0 R
/E (While investing in smaller companies comes with greater risk, it also creates the possibility for outsized returns that are often difficult to achieve with already established trillion-dollar businesses. For that reason, I am constantly searching for companies operating in growing industries with the potential to become tomorrow's market leaders. In this report, I will examine three companies within the rapidly expanding drone and autonomous systems industry that I believe deserve investors' attention.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
