210 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 170 0 R
/E (When it comes to emerging industries, I believe the drone sector offers some of the most attractive long-term opportunities in today's market. While ongoing geopolitical conflicts have accelerated demand, the bigger story is the rapid adoption of autonomous systems, AI, surveillance technology, communications networks, and counter-drone solutions across both military and civilian markets. The U.S. government continues to prioritize this space, with initiatives such as the Defense Autonomous Warfare Group \(DAWG\) reportedly receiving funding measured in the tens of billions, including a proposed $54.6 billion allocation focused on autonomous warfare technologies.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
