/E (Drones are also no longer limited to the battlefield. They are increasingly being used in border security, public safety, critical infrastructure, airports, energy facilities, and industrial operations. At the same time, strategic relationships such as Ondas' partnership with Palantir, UMAC's growing ties with the U.S. Department of Defense, and even Donald Trump Jr.'s involvement with Unusual Machines highlight the increasing attention and investment flowing into the sector. )
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [14]
>>
