/P 171 0 R
/E (At first glance, Ondas doesn't look like a great investment when you compare its recent performance to the broader market. However, it's important to remember that you typically don't strike gold or generate life-changing returns by investing in already mature, fully developed companies. Higher-growth opportunities often come with more risk, and Ondas is a good example of that. As a result, existing shareholders have experienced dilution as the company has issued additional shares to raise money. While dilution is never ideal, management appears to be betting that the capital raised today will help position the company for larger opportunities in the future.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
